[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m Simplifying further, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m 300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + i(468\cos\theta + 300\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(-36\cos\theta + 24\sin\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m Combining the real and imaginary parts, we get:
