[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m Let's calculate this value using Python.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m ```python
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m import math
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m # Coefficients
