[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m Combining these, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta)) + 24\cos\theta + 36i\cos\theta - 24i\sin\theta + 36\sin\theta
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m \[
