[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2} = \sqrt{104976 + 186624} = \sqrt{291600} = 540
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=283795)[0m 
